  "description": "AutoMapperLite is a lightweight, reflection-based object-to-object mapper for .NET — a small, dependency-minimal alternative to AutoMapper for mapping DTOs and entities. Targets net6.0 through net10.0. Features fluent CreateMap/ForMember/ForPath profiles, nested object and List<T> collection mapping, thread-safe configuration, and singleton-friendly dependency injection via AddAutoMapperLite. Built for projects that want a simple, dependency-minimal mapper without a large footprint; see the published benchmarks for how its reflection-based approach compares to compiled-expression mappers. Official site: https://automapperlite.atkhssn.info",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
